{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01LRTMx9H4ztPPk5Ej33U1hp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MigQPqg6g2sWp91RjCfQTu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/pinxbot/Desktop/ralph_loop && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\ntest: Security integration tests (Item 14)\n\n6 tests via WebApplicationContext + spring-security-test verifying full\nSpring Security 4.2 filter chain on /api/employees:\n\n- unauthenticated GET → 401 JSON (status + message + timestamp)\n- unauthenticated POST → 401 JSON\n- USER GET → 200 (security allows GET for USER role)\n- USER POST → 403 JSON (POST requires ADMIN)\n- ADMIN GET → 200 (security allows GET for ADMIN role)\n- ADMIN POST → 200 (ADMIN can POST)\n\nUses a stub @RestController so these tests run before EmployeeController\n(Item 16) is implemented. webAppContextSetup + SecurityMockMvcConfigurers\nrequired — standaloneSetup cannot apply the full FilterChainProxy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit Item 14 security integration tests"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":86938,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":373},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65e1815d-40a4-4def-9b3d-354e1ab2bece","uuid":"516dcd59-3ba3-48a9-ac71-9a84887b4f7a"}
